                    <p class="MsoNormal">
                        <span lang="EN-US">8</span><span style='font-family: 楷体_GB2312'>、院</span><span
                            lang="EN-US">(</span><span style='font-family: 楷体_GB2312'>系</span><span
                                lang="EN-US">)</span><span style='font-family: 楷体_GB2312'>教学院长（主任）意见</span>
