        <p class="MsoNormal" style='line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char'>
            <span
                style='font-size: 9.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: 宋体'>注：</span>
        </p>

        <p class="MsoNormal" style='margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char'>
            <span lang="EN-US" style='font-size: 9.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: 宋体'>1、<span style='font: 7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span></span><span
                style='font-size: 9.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: 宋体'>指导教师填写上述<span
                    lang="EN-US">1</span>～<span lang="EN-US">5</span>项。学生填上述第<span lang="EN-US">7</span>项。</span>
        </p>

        <p class="MsoNormal" style='margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char'>
            <span lang="EN-US" style='font-size: 9.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: 宋体'>2、<span style='font: 7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span></span><span
                style='font-size: 9.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: 宋体'>一个学生一个题目。需要多个学生完成的选题，分别填报选题。</span>
        </p>

        <p class="MsoNormal" style='margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 110%; layout-grid-mode: char'>
            <span lang="EN-US" style='font-size: 9.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: 宋体'>3、<span style='font: 7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span></span><span
                style='font-size: 9.0pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: 宋体'>下列情况的题目不宜安排学生做毕业设计（论文）：</span>
        </p>

        <p class="MsoNormal" style='margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: -7.7pt; margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-left: 21.0pt; margin-bottom: .0001pt; layout-grid-mode: char'>
            <span
                style='font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体'>（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）课题偏离本专业所学基本知识；（<span
                    lang="EN-US">2</span>）课题范围过专过窄，达不到全面训练的目的；（<span lang="EN-US">3</span>）属本科生难以胜任的高新技术；（<span
                        lang="EN-US">4</span>）毕业设计期间难以完成或不能取得阶段成果的。</span>
        </p>

        <p class="MsoNormal" style='margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: -7.7pt; margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-left: 18.0pt; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char'>
            <span lang="EN-US" style='font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体'>4、<span
                style='font: 7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span></span><span
                    style='font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体'>每个同学填报<span lang="EN-US">3</span>个志愿。为了使同学的志愿尽量得到满足，同学的志愿应有一定的分布，选择某个课题的同学不应太集中。若填报某项课题的同学太集中，人数超过了需要人数，可能会被调剂。</span>
        </p>

    </div>

</body>

</html>

